{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297550","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297550","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1029755001:1":{"text":"フーキンから聞いたけど、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>がミスリル商会とでっかい商売を計画してるんだって？","source_cn":"我是听呼金那小子说，秘银商会和<style=stres...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7DCE168E1817433D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"フーキンから聞いたけど、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>がミスリル商会とでっかい商売を計画してるんだって？","female":"フーキンから聞いたけど、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>がミスリル商会とでっかい商売を計画してるんだって？","variant_male_record_index":"104410","variant_female_record_index":"104411","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1029755002:0":{"text":"だったら、オルディン村も一枚噛ませてもらわないとなあ。","source_cn":"这种事可少不了我们深岩村吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48D0BE005D8C9530","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1029755002":{"text":"だったら、オルディン村も一枚噛ませてもらわないとなあ。","source_cn":"这种事可少不了我们深岩村吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48D0BE005D8C9530","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029755003:0":{"text":"オレらも今、ブライトの各地と契約を結び直して、特殊な鉱物の輸出とか、基礎部品の大量生産を請け負ってるけど――","source_cn":"要说通商，之前深岩村已经重新与耀光各地签了初步合作的契...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33E67202C4AE5C0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029755004:1":{"text":"アンタらが進めている事業は一味違うって、フーキンから聞いたぞ。","source_cn":"但我听呼金说，这次你们到处在忙的那什么合作方式不一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1FEF7B56B706F4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029755005:1":{"text":"各地の特産品や、色んな場所を観光できるそうじゃないか。そんなの、絶対に見逃せないだろ！","source_cn":"又有各地的特产往来，又有旅客可以到处游玩，我一听就心动了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01EE9706562146A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029755006:1":{"text":"村の方でも仕入れは必要だし、オレだってたまには外に出て遊びたいしな！","source_cn":"深岩村那边也有想采购的东西，更何况我自己也偶尔想出门逛逛嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24D2C4807F7FA43B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029755007:1":{"text":"だから、話を聞いてすぐこっちに来たんだ。","source_cn":"所以我听到消息第一时间就跑来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A14532E738E3032","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029755008:1":{"text":"聖石町に来るのも久しぶりだな。にしても、ここはあんま変わってないな。","source_cn":"好久没来圣石镇了，看起来这边变化也不大嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF4861F60B51E29B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029755009:1":{"text":"オイラの計画が上手くいって、交易が順調に進めば、この町も色々変わるかもな。","source_cn":"如果这段时间的贸易建设一切顺利，说不定圣石镇这边也会有...","status"